<title>PAKISTAN: Six wounded in explosion in Karachi.</title>
<headline>Six wounded in explosion in Karachi.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least six people were wounded on Saturday in an explosion in a house in the city of Karachi in southern Pakistan, police said.</p>
<p>Police said the cause of the explosion in District East was not immediately known. &quot;The number of injured people is likely to rise,&quot; an ambulance worker said.</p>
</text>
